l13: $ G , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ R ∪ csn ⟨ a , c ⟩ , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ∈ R ∪ csn ⟨ a , c ⟩ , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ R , i = a ∧ k = c ⇒ ¬ a ∊ cdm R $ by weaken [#2]
