l22: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (img (cgr x (cdm x)) A) , g ∊ img (cgr x (cdm x)) A , w ∊ g , f ∊ A , ⟨ f , g ⟩ ∈ cgr x (cdm x) ⇒ w ∊ g $ by ax
