-----------
d1: $ G , ord x , ∀ y (y ∊ x → y ∊ cdm g → y ∊ cdm h → g' y = h' y) , x ∊ cdm g , x ∊ cdm h ⇒ g ∊ trapx F $ by weaken [#1]
d2: $ G , ord x , ∀ y (y ∊ x → y ∊ cdm g → y ∊ cdm h → g' y = h' y) , x ∊ cdm g , x ∊ cdm h ⇒ h ∊ trapx F $ by weaken [#2]
d3: $ G , ord x , ∀ y (y ∊ x → y ∊ cdm g → y ∊ cdm h → g' y = h' y) , x ∊ cdm g , x ∊ cdm h ⇒ x ∊ cdm g $ by ax
d4: $ G , ord x , ∀ y (y ∊ x → y ∊ cdm g → y ∊ cdm h → g' y = h' y) , x ∊ cdm g , x ∊ cdm h ⇒ x ∊ cdm h $ by ax
