e11: $ … ⇒ u ∊ cdm g → u ∊ cdm h → g' u = h' u $ by imp_elim [e10, e3]
e12: $ … ⇒ u ∊ cdm h → g' u = h' u $ by imp_elim [e11, e5]
e13: $ … ⇒ g' u = h' u $ by imp_elim [e12, e8]
e14: $ G , ord x , ∀ y (y ∊ x → y ∊ cdm g → y ∊ cdm h → g' y = h' y) , x ∊ cdm g , x ∊ cdm h , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ g ↾ x ⇒ functional g $ by weaken [d5]
e15: $ G , ord x , ∀ y (y ∊ x → y ∊ cdm g → y ∊ cdm h → g' y = h' y) , x ∊ cdm g , x ∊ cdm h , ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ g ↾ x ⇒ functional h $ by weaken [d6]
e16: $ … ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ h $ by fv_pair_move [e14, e15, e4, e8, e13]
e17: $ … ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ ∈ h ↾ x $ by cres_intro [e3, e16]
