p13: $ … ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [p1]
p14: $ … ⇒ z ∈ h $ by wcel_eq_l [p13, p12]
p15: $ … ⇒ z ∊ h $ by wcel_welc [p14]
s3: $ … ⇒ z ∊ h $ by rel_elim [s1, s2, p15]
s4: $ … ⇒ g ⊆ h $ by subset_intro [s3]

trapx_chain
-----------
l1: $ … ⇒ ord (cdm g) $ by trapx_ord [#1]
l2: $ … ⇒ ord (cdm h) $ by trapx_ord [#2]
k1: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h ⇒ i = cdm g $ by ax
k2: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h ⇒ j = cdm h $ by ax
k3: $ … ⇒ cdm g = i $ by eq_sym [k1]
k4: $ … ⇒ cdm h = j $ by eq_sym [k2]
k5: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h ⇒ ord (cdm g) $ by weaken [l1]
k6: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h ⇒ ord (cdm h) $ by weaken [l2]
k7: $ … ⇒ ord i $ by ord_eq [k3, k5]
k8: $ … ⇒ ord j $ by ord_eq [k4, k6]
k9: $ … ⇒ i ⊆ j ∨ j ⊆ i $ by ord_subset_or [k7, k8]
a1: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h , i ⊆ j ⇒ i ⊆ j $ by ax
a2: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h , i ⊆ j ⇒ i = cdm g $ by ax
a3: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h , i ⊆ j ⇒ j = cdm h $ by ax
