a5: $ … ⇒ cdm g ⊆ cdm h $ by subset_eq_r [a3, a4]
a6: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h , i ⊆ j ⇒ g ∊ trapx F $ by weaken [#1]
a7: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h , i ⊆ j ⇒ h ∊ trapx F $ by weaken [#2]
a8: $ … ⇒ g ⊆ h $ by trapx_subset [a6, a7, a5]
a9: $ … ⇒ g ⊆ h ∨ h ⊆ g $ by or_intro_l [a8]
b1: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h , j ⊆ i ⇒ j ⊆ i $ by ax
b2: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h , j ⊆ i ⇒ i = cdm g $ by ax
b3: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h , j ⊆ i ⇒ j = cdm h $ by ax
b4: $ … ⇒ cdm h ⊆ i $ by subset_eq_l [b3, b1]
b5: $ … ⇒ cdm h ⊆ cdm g $ by subset_eq_r [b2, b4]
b6: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h , j ⊆ i ⇒ g ∊ trapx F $ by weaken [#1]
b7: $ G , i = cdm g , j = cdm h , j ⊆ i ⇒ h ∊ trapx F $ by weaken [#2]
b8: $ … ⇒ h ⊆ g $ by trapx_subset [b7, b6, b5]
b9: $ … ⇒ g ⊆ h ∨ h ⊆ g $ by or_intro_r [b8]
k10: $ … ⇒ g ⊆ h ∨ h ⊆ g $ by or_elim [k9, a9, b9]
c1: $ G ⇒ isset g $ by isset_var
c2: $ … ⇒ isset (cdm g) $ by cdm_set [c1]
c3: $ G ⇒ isset h $ by isset_var
c4: $ … ⇒ isset (cdm h) $ by cdm_set [c3]
c5: $ … ⇒ g ⊆ h ∨ h ⊆ g $ by isset_elim [c4, k10]
